<h1>circular queue</h1>
<p>
(data structure)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
An implementation of a <a href="boundedqueue.html"><em>bounded queue</em></a> using an <a href="array.html"><em>array</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="queue.html"><em>queue</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

